gm_lines:
**Prerequisite:** Radiance, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Charisma, Wisdom, or Constitution score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

During a Full Cultivation Session, you may maintain a circle of harmless dawn lamps.

Choose up to a number of willing creatures equal to your Proficiency Bonus.

Each chosen creature gains one of the following benefits until it completes a 10-minute recovery procedure:

Advantage on the first saving throw it makes against Frightened;

Advantage on the first saving throw it makes against Charmed;

Advantage on the first saving throw it makes against possession or spiritual contamination;

Temporary HP equal to your Proficiency Bonus.

A creature can benefit from only one Thousand-Lamp Meditation at a time.

